# ToyChain planted bug T25 (ST3a §6.2), minimised in 10 replays.
harness st3a/1
sut toychain
config block=1024 undo=240 subbatches=5 invalid=- effects=- presumed=-:- prune=8:2:- sub=- bug=T25
